# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of a
# contributor's local core.autocrlf setting or editor. Without this file,
# CHANGELOG.md was committed with CRLF at least once (via a GitHub web
# merge-conflict resolution), which broke auto-tag-release.yml's exact-match
# grep against "## [Unreleased]" on a Linux runner.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.go text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
